                <ul id="panel-quantum-deps-list" class="panel-quantum-deps-list"></ul>
              </div>
              <div id="panel-quantum-plan-block" class="panel-quantum-live-table-block" hidden>
                <h4 data-i18n="panel.modules.quantum.live.migrationPlanTitle">Önceliklendirilmiş geçiş planı</h4>
                <p id="panel-quantum-plan-note" class="panel-quantum-subsection-note" hidden data-i18n="panel.modules.quantum.live.migrationPlanNote">
                  Salt okunur öneri — otomatik migrasyon yok.
